<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets warrants on HSBC group.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets warrants on HSBC group.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday that Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, had issued one billion American-style call warrants on a basket of two banking stocks under the HSBC Holdings Plc group.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc    0.03 share</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd   0.01 share</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$6.289	  PREMIUM    10.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.1039	 GEARING    6.4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     12.JAN.98	 PAYDATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 BOARD LOT  10,000</p>
<p>GOVERNING LAW  HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
